=== 10. Āhuneyyasuttaṃ
<āhuneyyasuttaṃ>
#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 10)
+ ‘‘Navayime, bhikkhave, puggalā āhuneyyā pāhuneyyā dakkhiṇeyyā
