=== 6. Sandiṭṭhikanibbānasuttaṃ
<sandiṭṭhikanibbānasuttaṃ>
#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 47)
+ ‘‘‘Sandiṭṭhikaṃ nibbānaṃ sandiṭṭhikaṃ nibbāna'nti, āvuso, vuccati.
